WEBVTT

00:13:28.207 --> 00:13:35.076
physicians and veterinarians check 
their attitudes and their preconceptions

00:13:35.076 --> 00:13:41.100
at the door and come 
together as colleagues,

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:46.965
as peers, as doctors.

00:13:46.965 --> 00:13:52.385
After all, we humans 
are animals, too,

00:13:52.385 --> 00:13:55.845
and it's time for us physicians to embrace

00:13:55.845 --> 00:14:00.392
our patients' and our own animal natures